    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1173-a2">

                <pb facs="1184" n="1018" xml:id="pg1018"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2—Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Subsecretary of Foreign Affairs to Mr. Parker </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 37</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Querétaro</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-12-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 8, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Representative</hi>: Replying to note No. 212,
                    dated November 15, last, in which Vuestra Señoría stated advices had been
                    received to the effect that the Yaqui Indians continued to commit depredations
                    in the State of Sonora, I am pleased to inform you that the citizen military
                    commander of said entity has been urgently recommended to impart protection to
                    properties in that region, national as well as foreign.</p>
                <p>I am pleased to renew [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">A. M. Siller</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
